      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543612000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Isaac, and you've reached VeloFit Customer Support. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543620266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93309,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543627866666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. May I have your name and the order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543629866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Maria Garcia. Order is VF098712.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93309,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543636066666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Maria. One moment while I pull that up... Okay, I see the order for the VeloPro cycling shoes, delivered 31 days ago. To make sure I understand, what specifically is the issue with them? Is it a technical fault or a matter of preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543638399999
    },
    {
      "text": "They give me blisters. I can't ride in them for more than ten minutes. I've even tried adjusting the cleats.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93309,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543655133332
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. Comfort is crucial with cycling shoes, and getting blisters is definitely not the experience we aim for. I see here that this item falls under our standard return policy.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543662533332
    },
    {
      "text": "And?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93309,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543675999998
    },
    {
      "text": "And you are well within the 90-day return window. I can process this return for a full refund for you right now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543676699998
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. Just send the label.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 93309,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769543684366664
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. I've just sent a pre-paid return label to the email address on your account. Just pack the shoes in a box, attach the label, and drop it off with the carrier. Once we receive it, we'll issue the refund. Do you have any other questions for me?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
